    <bpmn:process id="W_W4161" name="W4161. Marketplace &amp; Third-Party Channel Content Syndication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Marketplace presence (VS-65); channel onboarding; catalog change
Frequency: Continuous feed
Volume: Lazada/Shopee and other marketplace catalogs (subset/full of 35,000 SKUs)
Owner: PIM Content Lead / Ecommerce Marketplace (VS-65)
Participants: Marketplace ops (VS-65), Ecommerce (VS-10), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4161 — Marketplace &amp; Third-Party Channel Content Syndication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4161_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4161_Lane1" name="PIM Content Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4161_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4161_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4161_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4161_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4161_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4161_Start3" name="Marketplace presence (VS-65); channel onboarding; catalog change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4161_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4161_Task4" name="PIM/Ecommerce map BuildRight&#x27;s canonical content to each marketplace&#x27;s required…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PIM/Ecommerce map BuildRight&#x27;s canonical content to each marketplace&#x27;s required taxonomy/attributes (Lazada/Shopee categories differ), and configure the feed transform rules per channel
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Marketplace Ops
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Per channel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4161_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4161_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4161_Task5" name="PIM/Ecommerce run the syndication feed (product/price/availability/asset)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PIM/Ecommerce run the syndication feed (product/price/availability/asset), monitor marketplace acceptance/rejections, and remediate category-mapping errors
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Ecommerce Ops
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4161_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4161_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4161_Task6" name="PIM/Ecommerce handle marketplace-specific content (promotional copy, bundle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PIM/Ecommerce handle marketplace-specific content (promotional copy, bundle listings, sponsored-content assets links to VS-48 retail media), and measure channel performance (W4163)
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Marketplace Ops
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4161_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4161_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4161_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4161_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4161_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-643 (ensure controlled execution — Content Syndication, Channel Publishing &amp; PIM Analytics (PA-137.3).) | - CTL-643: marketplace content sourced from canonical PIM (no manual channel-side edits); feed-error SLA
Owner: PIM Content Lead / Ecommerce Marketplace (VS-65)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4161_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4161_Annotation8" targetRef="W4161_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4161_Flow10" sourceRef="W4161_Start3" targetRef="W4161_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4161_Flow11" sourceRef="W4161_Task4" targetRef="W4161_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4161_Flow12" sourceRef="W4161_Task5" targetRef="W4161_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4161_Flow13" sourceRef="W4161_Task6" targetRef="W4161_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
