    <bpmn:process id="W_W4164" name="W4164. Content-Driven Conversion, Attach &amp; Basket Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Performance review; cross-sell/attach objective
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~2.8M monthly POS + ~42,900 ecommerce orders/mo; ~600K loyalty members
Owner: PIM Content Lead / Ecommerce Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Ecommerce (VS-10), Merchandising (VS-01), Customer/CDP (VS-126), Selling-enablement (VS-124)
Source: workflow W4164 — Content-Driven Conversion, Attach &amp; Basket Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4164_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4164_Lane1" name="PIM Content Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4164_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4164_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4164_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4164_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4164_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4164_Start3" name="Performance review; cross-sell/attach objective">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4164_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4164_Task4" name="PIM/Analytics measure content&#x27;s revenue impact — conversion lift from complete…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PIM/Analytics measure content&#x27;s revenue impact — conversion lift from complete vs incomplete content, attach from cross-sell/bundle (W4151), basket-size from how-to/rich content (W4156)
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Analytics
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4164_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4164_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4164_Task5" name="PIM/Merchandising measure cross-sell/bundle attach effectiveness (W4151) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PIM/Merchandising measure cross-sell/bundle attach effectiveness (W4151) and clienteling/personalization lift (VS-126/VS-124) attributable to content, by category
Responsible (R): PIM Content Lead / Merchandising / CDP
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4164_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4164_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4164_Task6" name="PIM/Ecommerce report content-ROI (content investment vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PIM/Ecommerce report content-ROI (content investment vs conversion/attach/basket lift), prioritize the content backlog, and feed into merchandising/selling strategy (VS-01/VS-124)
