      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Data-quality audit; duplicate detection; governance review
Frequency: Continuous + periodic
Volume: ~55,000 SKU master; dedup across imports/brands
Owner: PIM Product Owner / Data Governance (VS-28.2)
Participants: Data stewards, Merchandising (VS-01), MDM (VS-29), Audit (VS-21)
