      <bpmn:userTask id="W4166_Task4" name="PIM/Data Gov run catalog data-quality checks — duplicates (same SKU ranged…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: PIM/Data Gov run catalog data-quality checks — duplicates (same SKU ranged twice), inconsistencies (conflicting specs across channels), orphaned/incomplete records — and log issues
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / Data Gov
Accountable (A): PIM Owner
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4166_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4166_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
