        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: PIM/Merchandising resolve duplicates (merge/retire), standardize attribute values (links to W4146 dictionary), and remediate Global Source/brand registry (GSR) mismatches across import vendors
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / Merchandising / Sourcing
Accountable (A): PIM Owner
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4166_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4166_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
