        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PIM/Data Gov report data-quality KPIs to governance (VS-28.2 W2392/VS-133), prevent recurrence via intake controls (W4152), and support audit (VS-21)
Responsible (R): PIM Owner / Data Gov
Accountable (A): Director Ecommerce
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4166_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4166_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
